error: failed to run custom build command for `zpico-sys v0.6.0 (<repo>/packages/rmw/zenoh/zpico-sys)`
"-m64" "-I" "<repo>/packages/pl
  ...
nros-rust/x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/nros-relwithdebinfo/build/zpico-sys
  cause: zephyr/cmake/nros_cargo_build.cmake nros_detect_rust_target() has no arm for
  CONFIG_CPU_CORTEX_M0PLUS, so the nano-ros Rust lane falls through to the HOST triple
  and cc-rs hands arm-zephyr-eabi-gcc `-m64`. A Cortex-M0+ board needs a
  thumbv6m-none-eabi mapping (and thumbv6m has no native CAS atomics: whether the
  nros crates build there is unmeasured). Not pursued: the board has no twin either way.

